rem 1) Sign up free at metered.ca, create a TURN credential.
rem 2) Fill in the 3 lines below with the exact values from your dashboard.
rem 3) Rename this file to turn-settings.bat (remove ".example").
set TURN_URLS=turn:global.relay.metered.ca:80,turn:global.relay.metered.ca:443,turns:global.relay.metered.ca:443?transport=tcp
set TURN_USERNAME=PUT-YOUR-USERNAME-HERE
set TURN_CREDENTIAL=PUT-YOUR-PASSWORD-HERE
